<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net sellers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				     Week to May 23    Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		   8,114.38	   144,293.02</p>
<p>    - sales			 9,167.17	   132,297.78</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)  (1,052.78)	   11,995.24</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
